    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 10th level, each time you make an attack as part of the Attack action, you can teleport up to 10 feet before or after the attack. This teleportation doesn't provoke opportunity attacks and doesn't require your afterimage to be active.</p>\n<p>Additionally, your walking speed increases by an additional 10 feet (total of +20 feet from Blitzkrieg features).</p>",
